# If you prefer the allow list template instead of the deny list, see community template:
# https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore
#
# Binaries for programs and plugins
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Test binary, built with `go test -c`
*.test

# Code coverage profiles and other test artifacts
*.out
coverage.out
coverage.txt
*.coverprofile
profile.cov

# Dependency directories (remove the comment below to include it)
# vendor/

# Go workspace file
go.work
go.work.sum

# env file
.env

# Editor/IDE
# .idea/
# .vscode/

# gsd-core (local ZCode install — managed by `npx @opengsd/gsd-core`)
.zcode/
gsd-file-manifest.json
gsd-install-state.json

# spikes/ throwaway module build artifacts (D-05: go.sum + built binaries are
# NOT committed; spike .go source + go.mod + findings ARE committed)
spikes/go.sum
spikes/bin/
/spikes/**/bin/

# Phase 1 build artifacts (Plan 01-01 T1)
/ass-guard
*.log

# Phase 6 distribution artifacts (Plan 06-02): goreleaser output + the snapshot
# build dir. agent.json is generated at release by scripts/gen-agent-json.sh but
# the committed dev placeholder IS tracked (do not ignore it).
/dist/

# .ass-guard/ is the per-machine runtime dir (Phase-6 first-run seed:
# materialized profiles + openspec.toml + config.yaml + learned.yaml).
# It also holds local secrets — e.g. api_key, config.yaml with a provider key.
# Never commit: generated from embedded defaults + may carry credentials.
.ass-guard/


# Phase 14 / 14-03: pinned shallow clone of github.com/earendil-works/pi used as the
# read-only behavioral spec for docs/shaper-pi-audit.md. Never committed; re-clone
# per the audit header. (14-06: extend tools/ ignores beside this entry, do not restructure.)
tools/pi-audit/

# Phase 14 / 14-06: pinned shallow clone of github.com/ruvnet/open-claude-code (occ)
# used as the read-only surface census for docs/tool-contract-inventory.md. Never
# committed; re-clone per the census fixture's provenance header (INPUT ONLY — the
# committed artifact is internal/toolexec/testdata/occ-census.json, names only).
tools/occ-census-clone/
